@node Overview
@chapter Overview

@samp{tlon-youtube} provides functionality for processing and uploading podcast episodes to YouTube. It covers the full workflow: generating animated wavelength videos from audio files, creating thumbnails with ImageMagick, uploading videos and thumbnails via the YouTube Data API v3 (using OAuth 2.0 with resumable uploads), and managing playlist assignments. Authentication is handled by the @samp{oauth2-auto} library.

