@node @code{tlon-youtube-upload-thumbnail}
@subsection @code{tlon-youtube-upload-thumbnail}

@findex tlon-youtube-upload-thumbnail

Upload a thumbnail image to an existing YouTube video.

You are prompted for a thumbnail file (filtered to @samp{.png}, @samp{.jpg}, and @samp{.jpeg} files) and a YouTube video ID@. The thumbnail is uploaded via the YouTube API using OAuth 2.0 authentication.

Requires @code{tlon-youtube-client-id} and @code{tlon-youtube-client-secret} to be configured.

