@node @code{tlon-youtube-add-to-playlist}
@subsection @code{tlon-youtube-add-to-playlist}

@findex tlon-youtube-add-to-playlist

Add an existing YouTube video to a playlist.

You are prompted for a YouTube video ID and a playlist selection from the playlists defined in @code{tlon-youtube-playlists}. This is useful for adding videos to playlists without re-uploading.

Requires @code{tlon-youtube-client-id} and @code{tlon-youtube-client-secret} to be configured.

