@section @code{tlon-youtube-playlists}

@vindex tlon-youtube-playlists

Alist of playlist names and their corresponding YouTube playlist IDs. Each entry is a cons cell @samp{(NAME . ID)}. These playlists are offered as choices when uploading a video or adding a video to a playlist.

@node @code{tlon-youtube-thumbnail-command-template}
@section @code{tlon-youtube-thumbnail-command-template}

@vindex tlon-youtube-thumbnail-command-template

ImageMagick command template for generating YouTube thumbnails. This is a format string with 27 positional arguments controlling DPI, canvas dimensions, fonts, text content, logo placement, and output path. Used internally by @code{tlon-youtube-generate-thumbnail}.

